  "changes": [
    "Env/sdk_file_digest!: sha256 of an SDK image file hashed once per VM (immutable /nix/store path) or while its (size,mtime,ctime,inode,device) stamp is unchanged and settled (>=3 s old); caller compares with the sealed row as before",
    "Env/sdk_image_metadata_at!: decoded artifact metadata returned without re-reading the file when the file digest equals the sealed row digest and that artifact was already decoded in this VM",
    "AOT image_sdk_entry!, sdk_source_current?, sdk_declaration_evidence! and Env sdk_inventory_sources_current? use them",
    "PackageAuthority kernel_factory_origins!: the disassembly of the two kernel adapter modules is memoized by module, MD5, bytes digest and decoder MD5",
    "AOT sdk_kernel_primitive_routes!: pre_loaded set built once, not once per row"
  ],
